<main>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <i class="el" data-el="berry" data-depth=".6" style="--x:78%;--y:150px;--r:24deg;--s:1.2"></i>
    <i class="el" data-el="drop" data-depth=".4" style="--x:88%;--y:300px;--r:-10deg;--s:.8"></i>
    <div class="wrap settle">
      <p class="label">Legal · purpleherb.in</p>
      <h1 class="script">returns &amp; refunds</h1>
      <p style="color:var(--muted);font-size:14px">Effective date: July 9, 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <div class="wrap legal-body">
    <aside class="legal-toc" aria-label="On this page"><p class="label">On this page</p><ol id="toc"></ol></aside>
    <article class="legal-content">
<section id="intro" class="settle"><h2>Our promise</h2><p>At PURPLEHERB, we want you to be completely satisfied with your purchase. If you're not happy with your order, we're here to help.</p></section>
<section id="eligibility" class="settle"><h2>Return eligibility</h2><p>You may return most new, unopened items within 30 days of delivery for a full refund. Items must be in their original condition and packaging.</p><ul><li>Products must be unused and in original packaging</li><li>Returns must be initiated within 30 days of delivery</li><li>Proof of purchase is required</li></ul></section>
<section id="how" class="settle"><h2>How to return an item</h2><p>To initiate a return, please follow these steps:</p><ol><li>Contact our customer service team</li><li>Provide your order number and reason for return</li><li>Receive your return authorization and shipping label</li><li>Pack the item securely in its original packaging</li><li>Ship the item back to us</li></ol></section>
<section id="address" class="settle"><h2>Return address</h2><p>Our team will share the return address along with your return authorization, so your parcel reaches the right place.</p></section>
<section id="damaged" class="settle"><h2>Damaged or defective items</h2><p>If you receive a damaged or defective item, please contact us immediately. We will arrange for a replacement or full refund at no additional cost to you.</p><p>Please include photos of the damaged item and packaging when contacting us.</p></section>
<section id="non-returnable" class="settle"><h2>Non-returnable items</h2><p>The following items cannot be returned:</p><ul><li>Opened or used health and wellness products</li><li>Perishable goods</li><li>Gift cards</li><li>Downloadable products</li><li>Personal care items</li></ul></section>
<section id="exchanges" class="settle"><h2>Exchanges</h2><p>We currently only offer refunds. If you need a different item, please place a new order and return the original item for a refund.</p></section>
<section id="refunds" class="settle"><h2>Refund process</h2><p>Once we receive your return, we will inspect the item and process your refund. Refunds will be issued to your original payment method.</p></section>
<section id="timeline" class="settle"><h2>Refund timeline</h2><p>Refunds are typically processed within 5–7 business days after we receive your return. Please allow an additional 3–5 business days for the refund to appear in your account.</p></section>
<section id="cancel" class="settle"><h2>Order cancellation</h2><p>You may cancel your order within 24 hours of placing it for a full refund. After 24 hours, standard return policies apply.</p></section>
<section id="costs" class="settle"><h2>Return shipping costs</h2><p>Return shipping costs are the responsibility of the customer unless the item is defective or we made an error. We recommend using a trackable shipping service.</p></section>
<section id="international" class="settle"><h2>International returns</h2><p>International customers are responsible for return shipping costs and any customs fees. Please contact us before returning an international order.</p></section>
<section id="contact" class="settle"><h2>Contact us</h2><p>If you have any questions about our return policy, please contact us:</p><ul><li>Email: <a href="mailto:support@purpleherb.in">support@purpleherb.in</a></li><li>WhatsApp: <a href="https://wa.me/919000016479">+91 90000 16479</a></li><li>Hours: Monday – Friday, 9:00 AM – 6:00 PM IST</li></ul></section>

      <div class="settle"><p class="label">Other policies</p><div class="legal-others"><a class="stone" href="/pages/privacy-policy">Privacy</a><a class="stone" href="/pages/shipping-policy">Shipping</a><a class="stone" href="/pages/terms-of-service">Terms</a></div></div>
    </article>
  </div>
</main>
